  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> hybridization</p><p>In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Co</mi></math> is in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math> oxidation state with the configuration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math>. In the presence of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> a strong ligand, the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math> electrons pair up leaving two d-orbitals empty. Hence, the hybridization is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>forming an inner orbital octahedral complex. </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BrF</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> hybridization</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>PtCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>dsp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> hybridization</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> hybridization</p>",
    "image": null
  },
